          "short": "$11$",
          "worked": "$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x}{5}+7&=\\frac{20}{5}+7\\\\\\frac{x}{5}+7&=4+7\\\\\\frac{x}{5}+7&=11\\end{align*}$",
